cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Electronic nose recordings and headspace GC–MS profiles of two palm cooking oils under repeated heating"
abstract: >-
  Raw electronic-nose recordings, raw headspace GC–MS reports, analysis code,
  and computed results for the article "Screening of repeatedly heated palm
  cooking oil using a phase-aware low-cost electronic nose and GC–MS". The
  code reproduces the results of that article from the data in the data folder
  of this repository.
type: software
license: CC-BY-4.0
